<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 1.3 Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept id="t00209">
	<title>Operating relaxion comfort seat</title>
	<shortdesc/>
	<conbody>
		<table frame="none" colsep="1" rowsep="1" outputclass="formatc_none" id="e01304">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="1" rowsep="1" outputclass="FormatA">
				<colspec colnum="1" colname="1" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colnum="2" colname="2" colwidth="50*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="0">
						<entry colname="1" colsep="0">
							<fig id="e01305">
								<figgroup>
									<image href="images/N_SP327_B06_014_1.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
								</figgroup>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="2"/>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<section deliveryTarget="except_print" id="e01306">
			<title>Operation</title>
			<ol id="e01307">
				<li>
					<p>Press the rear portion of the relaxion comfort seat switch (1) for more than approximately 1 second to move to the relaxation comfort seat position.</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>If the relaxion comfort seat is operating, press the following buttons to stop the operation.</p>
					<ul id="e01308">
						<li>
							<p>Seat adjustment switch (reclining, cushion height)</p>
						</li>
						<li>
							<p>Relaxion comfort seat switch</p>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>After operating the relaxation comfort seat, you can adjust it for a more comfortable posture using the seat adjustment switch.</p>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</section>
		<section deliveryTarget="except_print" id="e01309">
			<title>Non-operating conditions</title>
			<ul id="e01310">
				<li>
					<p>When the vehicle is in R (Reverse)/N (Neutral)/D (Drive) position</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>When the vehicle speed is above 5 km/h (3 mph)</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>When the driver position memory system needs initialization</p>
				</li>
			</ul>
		</section>
	</conbody>
	<related-links>
